{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">花旗：英维克2Q26业绩连续四季度未达预期，国内毛利率降至20.9%</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">英维克（002837.SZ）的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>财报，延续了此前三个季度的趋势：收入还在增长，利润却在调整。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>在最新研报中给出明确判断——这是自<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>以来连续第四个季度业绩低于市场预期，且国内业务毛利率仍在调整正在加深，已经跌破此前九年低点。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看数字。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>上半年，英维克收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30.17亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17.2%</span>，但归母净利润下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14.3%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.85亿元</span>，核心净利润下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13.2%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.75亿元</span>。收入与利润的背离，核心原因在于毛利率的持续压缩。国内业务毛利率同比下降2.06个百分点至20.9%，这个数字已经低于2025年上半年创下的23.0%前九年低点。海外业务毛利率虽然仍高达48.2%，但同比也大幅调整了6.24个百分点。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把这件事拆开看，国内市场竞争对英维克的影响比市场此前预期的更深。机房温控（占上半年收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">56%</span>）收入增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25.8%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17亿元</span>，但毛利率下降2.49个百分点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">23.3%</span>；机柜温控（占收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">35%</span>，主要为储能相关）收入增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15.3%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10.68亿元</span>，毛利率下降1.32个百分点至26.8%。两个核心业务板块都没有显示出毛利率韧性。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWfY7cE82APkQCeaYS1x85UqU0TibjicvDnvrRTczOmIBkrYUdmP3UrY7XftpQfFBtVy2UowYqGdlPj4xce3Bdj282iczwMLK1uU4/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 海外收入占比提升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14.7%</span>，但体量仍不足以扭转整体毛利率</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">海外业务是这份财报中少数几个亮点之一。上半年海外收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">71.4%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.44亿元</span>，占比从一年前的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10.1%</span>提升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14.7%</span>。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>在报告中特别指出，海外毛利率的调整幅度（6.24个百分点）比其预测的更差，因为过去十年海外毛利率一直相当稳定。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">但这里的关键限制在于体量。海外收入占比不足<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>，即便毛利率远高于国内，对整体毛利率的拉动作用仍然有限。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>的结论是，海外<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>无法对冲国内竞争带来的毛利率仍在调整，国内竞争格局仍在调整的判断依然成立。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看海外收入占比这个数字，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14.7%</span>意味着海外业务还处在“有故事但没分量”的阶段。简单说，海外毛利率再高，只要占比不突破某个临界点，对整体毛利率的拉动就会被国内业务的跌幅吞掉。我更关注的是海外收入增速能否在后续几个季度维持<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">70%</span>以上的水平，这决定了占比爬升的速度。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX6ngVXl0eryBpOy7Cdqw9ZnYXb1Mibe2IddnnF8zKp0TLmibPJOMBSibnp8SA3icaic6asxGnFuIWU2wHiaLmdW2WicEfwYVvR3fZDZ0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 存货同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">58%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15.52亿元</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>认为这预示<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>收入增速加快</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">资产负债表上有一个值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的信号。截至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>上半年末，英维克存货同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">58%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15.52亿元</span>。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>的解读是，这暗示<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>收入增长会<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>，因为公司通常会在收入确认前备货。二季度收入增速仅为17%，如果三季度确实如存货所预示的那样加速，那么收入端的不确定性会有所缓解。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">但存货增加也带来一个问题：如果收入增长<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">不及预期</span>，存货积压将反过来侵蚀现金流和利润。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>对此的表述是“与我们的预测基本一致”，言下之意，这并不改变其对全年盈利的判断。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">另一个积极信号是经营现金流的<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXRah8icL9ww9m8PgsoNzBtrMoftyuVYlmp8CiaC9wQeH1bCpogSoCU8md6iaRQ8RgOV1uoATkPeVvdk0xcvnaUuxnfZQsViaNukZs/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWf0exzp0mkpnMWTmxaRHkmG5yNXl48J0ENqWcn3qeJxRqcOfiaNCIfE40mOwhACSAwItrlMia2LVSsUGMHBQVaBo3HRUicianIcI8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 15-CITI-Shenzhen Envicool Technology -002837- 2Q26 Results Miss Again- the Fourth Quarterly Results Miss In A Row-260824</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
